WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.424
[MUSIC]

00:00:07.424 --> 00:00:10.733
SPEAKER: Some people
like going to the opera.

00:00:10.733 --> 00:00:14.823
Others like watching dog fights.

00:00:14.826 --> 00:00:20.758
Suppose the lovers of dog fighting
vastly outnumber the opera lovers.

00:00:20.758 --> 00:00:26.903
In that case, should government
subsidize dog fights rather than opera?

00:00:26.903 --> 00:00:31.623
[MUSIC]

